-- title:
--   Original stopped Gaussian inclusive crossing spatial absolute sum vanishes a.s.
-- statement:
--   The absolute discounted spatial increment in the unique original genuine inclusive crossing cell tends to zero almost surely as the physical mesh shrinks, with no active cell giving zero.
-- source:
